{"3455320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Supre-Immune", "steam_appid": 3455320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/322c4045fce6ccbeb8076265d1312e00.avif?t=1782846124\" width=616 height=105 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A charming action adventure where you fight viruses alongside adorable immune cells!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viruses have invaded the body! As a doctor, you'll control immune cells to fight infections and experience the joy of growing stronger with each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve into cells with different weapons and abilities every time as you nurture your very own special immune cell. An exciting adventure awaits with these lovable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧬 Special Fun Elements You Can Experience in Supre-Immune</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/09fe7d21151d7a4c02ce30fcd7131714.avif?t=1782846124\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike action game set in the human immune system! With a structure of fast-paced combat and strategic growth, it offers the joy of new challenges and growth every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/46ccd66dfb00e1aa82edad0cefb38a16.poster.avif?t=1782846124\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/46ccd66dfb00e1aa82edad0cefb38a16.webm?t=1782846124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/46ccd66dfb00e1aa82edad0cefb38a16.mp4?t=1782846124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/92ac003b2a8b04d60e63965657e9b8d7.avif?t=1782846124\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immune cells with round eyes and expressive personalities are waiting for you! With their cute design featuring cell nuclei and cell membranes, you'll find yourself smiling even during intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/fb7bf778e450b63216cf3514c43f8a8d.poster.avif?t=1782846124\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/fb7bf778e450b63216cf3514c43f8a8d.webm?t=1782846124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/fb7bf778e450b63216cf3514c43f8a8d.mp4?t=1782846124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/128725b76a894b2a7e60bfdde6436dd3.avif?t=1782846124\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex controls needed! Anyone can easily enjoy the game with simple movement controls. Since weapons automatically find and attack enemies, you can focus solely on strategic positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/8482630a2009919a7718acb238e14eaa.poster.avif?t=1782846124\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/8482630a2009919a7718acb238e14eaa.webm?t=1782846124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/8482630a2009919a7718acb238e14eaa.mp4?t=1782846124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4adfd2ec0d847bc690d0649fbf9a87a9.avif?t=1782846124\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most exciting moment begins when combat ends! Use collected data to evolve into cells with new weapons and special abilities. Completely different adventures unfold depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/72193960cc60ae9789792c892a8e750f.poster.avif?t=1782846124\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/72193960cc60ae9789792c892a8e750f.webm?t=1782846124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/72193960cc60ae9789792c892a8e750f.mp4?t=1782846124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4234a0423625dd03a3427ca6a9e26fbc.avif?t=1782846124\" width=601 heigh